{"title":"BIM未来发展的几个关键应用环节","date":"2018-05-15","content":"<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 6pt; text-align: center; line-height: 22.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:21.0pt;font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#444444;mso-font-kerning:18.0pt\">BIM</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:21.0pt;font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\r\ncolor:#444444;mso-font-kerning:18.0pt\">未来发展的几个关键应用环节</span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 6pt; text-align: center; line-height: 22.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:21.0pt;font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\r\ncolor:#444444;mso-font-kerning:18.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 6pt; text-align: center; line-height: 22.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 6pt; line-height: 22.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14pt;\">近年来，国家大力推广</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14pt;\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14pt;\">互联网</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14pt;\">+&rdquo;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14pt;\">在建筑行业中的应用，</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14pt;\">BIM</span><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14pt;\">也随之在行业中应用越来越广。目前，</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14pt;\">3D BIM</span><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14pt;\">技术的应用已经较为成熟，建筑行业的</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14pt;\">BIM</span><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14pt;\">技术即将迎来</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14pt;\">4D</span><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14pt;\">、</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14pt;\">5D</span><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14pt;\">的时代。</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 6pt; line-height: 22.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 6pt; line-height: 22.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<section class=\"_editor\">\r\n\t<section style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 8px;margin-bottom: 8px;\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: middle;width: 10px;height: 10px;border-radius: 50%;background-color: #0c8918;box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t<section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: middle;border-left: 2px solid #0c8918;border-right: 2px solid #0c8918;box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"color: #0c8918;letter-spacing: 1px;line-height: 22px;text-align: justify;padding-right: 5px;padding-left: 5px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"font-size: 15px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<strong><span style=\"font-size: 20px;font-family: 华文中宋;color: #444444\"><strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 21px; font-family: 宋体;\">关于5D BIM</span></strong></strong>​</span></strong></p>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t<section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: middle;width: 10px;height: 10px;border-radius: 50%;background-color: #0c8918;box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n</section>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 6pt; line-height: 22.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; text-align: center;\">\r\n\t<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201805/T1C4E_BydT1RCvBVdK.png\" style=\"width: 635px; height: 344px;\" /></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 6pt; line-height: 22.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; text-align: center;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; text-indent: 28.1pt; line-height: 22.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nArial;color:#444444\">5D BIM</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#444444\">是在<span lang=\"EN-US\">3D</span>建筑信息模型基础上，融入<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>时间进度信息<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>与<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>成本造价信息<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span></span></b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#444444\">，形成由<span lang=\"EN-US\">3D</span>模型<span lang=\"EN-US\">+ 1D</span>进度<span lang=\"EN-US\">+ 1D</span>造价的五维建筑信息模型。<span lang=\"EN-US\">5D BIM</span>集成了工程量、工程进度及造价信息，能链接建筑构件的<span lang=\"EN-US\">3D</span>模型与施工进度，动态地模拟施工变化过程，可实时监控施工进度及成本造价。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; text-indent: 28pt; line-height: 22.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#444444\">可以说<span lang=\"EN-US\">5D BIM</span>是建筑业信息化技术、虚拟建造技术的核心基础，<b>通过<span lang=\"EN-US\">5D BIM</span>才能实现以<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>进度控制<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;&ldquo;</span>投资控制<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;&ldquo;</span>质量控制<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;&ldquo;</span><span style=\"border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:\r\nnone windowtext 0cm;padding:0cm\">合同管理</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;&ldquo;</span>资源管理<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>为目标的数字化<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>三控两管<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>项目总控系统。</b></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; text-indent: 28pt; line-height: 22.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#444444\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; text-indent: 28pt; line-height: 22.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<section class=\"_editor\">\r\n\t<section style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 8px;margin-bottom: 8px;\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: middle;width: 10px;height: 10px;border-radius: 50%;background-color: #0c8918;box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t<section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: middle;border-left: 2px solid #0c8918;border-right: 2px solid #0c8918;box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"color: #0c8918;letter-spacing: 1px;line-height: 22px;text-align: justify;padding-right: 5px;padding-left: 5px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"font-size: 15px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<strong><span style=\"font-size: 20px;font-family: 华文中宋;color: #444444\"><strong><strong><strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 21px; font-family: 宋体;\">5D BIM</span><span style=\"font-size: 21px; font-family: 宋体;\">的优势</span></strong></strong></strong></strong></span></strong></p>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t<section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: middle;width: 10px;height: 10px;border-radius: 50%;background-color: #0c8918;box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n</section>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; text-indent: 28pt; line-height: 22.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; text-align: center;\">\r\n\t<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201805/T1M4E_ByYT1RCvBVdK.png\" style=\"width: 639px; height: 341px;\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; text-indent: 28pt; line-height: 22.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; line-height: 22.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nmso-ascii-font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#444444\">1.</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#444444\">实现对工程更全面、精准的了解与控制<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; text-indent: 28pt; line-height: 22.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#444444\">脱离云计算和大数据的<span lang=\"EN-US\">BIM</span>中的大量数据无法被有效管理和利用，工程人员对整个工程项目的分析和认知仅依靠一些易于获取和处理的特征数据，对工程项目的控制出现偏差的概率较大。而<span lang=\"EN-US\">5D BIM</span>使得对海量数据的管理和利用成为可能，人们可以对工程项目的所有数据进行分类、整合、管理和利用。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; line-height: 22.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nmso-ascii-font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#444444\">2.</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#444444\">降低基础硬件投入<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; text-indent: 28pt; line-height: 22.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#444444\">目前，应用较广的<span lang=\"EN-US\">BIM </span>软件如<span lang=\"EN-US\">Revit2014</span>、<span lang=\"EN-US\">Navisworks </span>等对计算机的硬件要求均较高，且大多数的工程项目资料容量常达<span lang=\"EN-US\">1tb</span>以上。随着工程项目的进一步开展，其工程信息数据处理更为复杂，难度更大。基于此，<span lang=\"EN-US\">5D BIM</span>技术通过大数据的云储存、云计算恰能较好地解决这一难题，不仅可降低<span lang=\"EN-US\">BIM</span>成本造价，还能提升工作效率。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; line-height: 22.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nmso-ascii-font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#444444\">3.</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#444444\">实现全方位即时协作，提高工作效率<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; text-indent: 28pt; line-height: 22.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#444444\">将<span lang=\"EN-US\">BIM</span>进行云储存，可通过互联网进行访问。建筑师设计的模型可通过云端直接在咨询顾问的电脑上打开，且对一个模型方案进行改进后，模型可通过互联网自动云同步更新，不需重新发布或共享新模型，如此一来，各地、各专业设计人员工作效率便可大幅提升。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; line-height: 22.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nmso-ascii-font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#444444\">4.</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#444444\">提高设计及管理的机动性，易于维护<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; text-indent: 28pt; line-height: 22.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#444444\">通过<span lang=\"EN-US\">5D BIM</span>，可实现任何人在任何时间、地点通过互联网对<span lang=\"EN-US\">BIM</span>软件和工程项目进行云端处理，大幅增强了管理上的机动性。而<span lang=\"EN-US\">5D BIM</span>通过云计算的实施过程简单明了，不需用户自行判断数据问题，可由云端直接下达安全警报或维护指令。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; line-height: 22.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nmso-ascii-font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#444444\">5.</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#444444\">提高项目管理精细度<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; text-indent: 28pt; line-height: 22.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nmso-ascii-font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#444444\">5D BIM</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#444444\">技术支持项目管理人员对各部门的下沉式追踪监控，用大数据强化管理精细度。将所有信息都集中反映在统一管理平台上，使管理部门在对项目有宏观决策把控的同时，能与各参与方做到有效互动及精细化管理。</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; text-indent: 28pt; line-height: 22.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#444444\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; text-indent: 28pt; line-height: 22.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<section class=\"_editor\">\r\n\t<section style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 8px;margin-bottom: 8px;\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: middle;width: 10px;height: 10px;border-radius: 50%;background-color: #0c8918;box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t<section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: middle;border-left: 2px solid #0c8918;border-right: 2px solid #0c8918;box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"color: #0c8918;letter-spacing: 1px;line-height: 22px;text-align: justify;padding-right: 5px;padding-left: 5px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"font-size: 15px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<strong><span style=\"font-size: 20px;font-family: 华文中宋;color: #444444\"><strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 21px; font-family: 宋体; border: 1px none windowtext; padding: 0px;\">应用</span><span style=\"font-size: 21px; font-family: 宋体;\">的关键及注意事项</span></strong></strong>​</span></strong></p>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t<section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: middle;width: 10px;height: 10px;border-radius: 50%;background-color: #0c8918;box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n</section>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 6pt; line-height: 22.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; text-align: center;\">\r\n\t<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201805/T1WNW_BybT1RCvBVdK.png\" style=\"width: 585px; height: 387px;\" /></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 6pt; line-height: 22.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; line-height: 22.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nmso-ascii-font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#444444\">1.</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#444444\">整合<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; text-indent: 28pt; line-height: 22.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nmso-ascii-font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#444444\">5D BIM</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#444444\">对于大数据的应用并不只是简单的数字叠加或集合，关键还是在于挖掘价值信息并进行有效集成，需进行人员整合、流程系统整合及软硬件资源整合。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; text-indent: 28pt; line-height: 22.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#444444\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>）人员整合。项目各部门在同一平台的协作是保证数据真实可靠的基础，故需建立新的工作模式，在项目初期就整合全部参与方，使其在互相信任的基础上共享信息，并培养团队的创新氛围，提高人员沟通效率和整体工作水平。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; text-indent: 28pt; line-height: 22.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#444444\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>）流程整合。数据只是点，流程才是串联数据的线，通过建立全流程管理平台，实现<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>设计<span lang=\"EN-US\">-</span>生产<span lang=\"EN-US\">-</span>运维<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>的一体化信息管理，通过集成碎片化数据提升项目效益。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; text-indent: 28pt; line-height: 22.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#444444\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">3</span>）软硬件整合。建筑的精细化管理需以<span lang=\"EN-US\">5D BIM</span>大数据全流程管理平台为支撑，以高性能计算机、主控中心、移动端等智能设备为载体，优化资源配置和数据交互，加快行业信息化发展进程。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; line-height: 22.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nmso-ascii-font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#444444\">2.</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#444444\">云平台运维<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; text-indent: 28pt; line-height: 22.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#444444\">工程项目在建立云平台后，须安排专人负责该平台的运行和维护问题，避免在平台的应用过程中出现无法登陆，无法查看相关内容等问题，从而影响工程项目的监控与进度控制。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; line-height: 22.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nmso-ascii-font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#444444\">3.</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#444444\">用户权限<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; text-indent: 28pt; line-height: 22.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#444444\">工程项目的参与方众多，涉及勘察、设计、建设、施工、监理、材料供应等诸多单位，因此，在<span lang=\"EN-US\">BIM</span>云平台的应用过程中需给予不同的参与方以不同的权限，分角色、专业，按不同单位的管理范围，相关合同的实施范围等划分权限。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; text-indent: 28pt; line-height: 22.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#444444\">如给予设计单位人员修改模型参数的权力；给予建设单位的管理人员全过程、全寿命周期内查阅模型、</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0cm;padding:0cm\">进度计划</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#444444\">、施工图片、材料管理等的权限；给予施工单位人员上传、编辑、删除施工过程的相关资料及查阅模型的权限，以避免管理上的混乱，增加协调工作难度等问题。</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; text-indent: 28pt; line-height: 22.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#444444\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; text-indent: 28pt; line-height: 22.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<section class=\"_editor\">\r\n\t<section style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 8px;margin-bottom: 8px;\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: middle;width: 10px;height: 10px;border-radius: 50%;background-color: #0c8918;box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t<section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: middle;border-left: 2px solid #0c8918;border-right: 2px solid #0c8918;box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"color: #0c8918;letter-spacing: 1px;line-height: 22px;text-align: justify;padding-right: 5px;padding-left: 5px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"font-size: 15px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<strong><span style=\"font-size: 20px;font-family: 华文中宋;color: #444444\"><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 21px; font-family: 宋体;\">5D BIM</span><span style=\"font-size: 21px; font-family: 宋体;\">技术应用的未来</span></strong></strong>​</strong></strong></strong></strong></span></strong></p>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t<section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: middle;width: 10px;height: 10px;border-radius: 50%;background-color: #0c8918;box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n</section>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 6pt; line-height: 22.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; text-align: center;\">\r\n\t<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201805/T1KFh_ByxT1RCvBVdK.png\" style=\"width: 623px; height: 314px;\" /></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 6pt; line-height: 22.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; line-height: 22.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nmso-ascii-font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#444444\">1.</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#444444\">信用建设<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; text-indent: 28pt; line-height: 22.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#444444\">国家发改委副主任连维良曾表示，信用建设必须以大数据为支撑，以大数据为支撑的信用建设手段，对于加强对市场主体的服务和监管具有非常重要的作用。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; text-indent: 28pt; line-height: 22.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#444444\">我国建筑市场中各方普遍存在信用缺失的情况，诚信<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>短板<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>问题突出，导致工程质量问题并埋下安全隐患。未来，通过大数据平台动态记录信息，通过建筑市场管理和</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0cm;padding:0cm\">施工现场</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#444444\">监管有效联动，可实现<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>数据一个库、监管一张网、管理一条线<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; line-height: 22.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nmso-ascii-font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#444444\">2.</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#444444\">服务商市场<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; text-indent: 28pt; line-height: 22.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nmso-ascii-font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:\r\nminor-fareast;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#444444\">5D BIM</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#444444\">的应用离不开云技术，根据以往国内<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>互联网<span lang=\"EN-US\">+&rdquo;</span>的发展模式，不久后我们就将迎来国内<span lang=\"EN-US\">BIM</span>技术服务商的集中爆发期，届时的市场竞争必定空前火爆。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 6pt; line-height: 22.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 6pt; line-height: 22.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 6pt; line-height: 22.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 6pt; line-height: 22.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 6pt; line-height: 22.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 6pt; line-height: 22.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 6pt; line-height: 22.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.0pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>"}